Z||000000||RedHaze86SD4||11-30-2001||05:07 PM||||I found an '89-'90 grand am turbo at our local pick-n-pull.. the only thing wrong with the entire motor assembly is that the the block is cracked.. I've already torn it apart and everything seems to be in decent shape. they want 450 for everything. Thats trans, head, intake, covers, exhaust manifold, turbo, and mounts... So.. Would it be worth the 450 and if it actually is. Would putting it in a 86 Fiero be worth it??? I'm going for the tranny either way, and maybe even the turbo.. wish it had a cooler but its been yanked already.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/redhaze1_1.GIF"> ||||reg||5
